= First Section
- $abs({1,2,3}) = < oo$ (countably finite)
- $abs({[0,1] in RR}) = < oo$ (uncountable finite)
- $abs(ZZ) = aleph_0$ (countably infinite)
- $abs(RR) = aleph_1$ (uncountable infinite)

